WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.115 --> 00:00:14.614
Ribby was reading to Jeremy.

2
00:00:14.615 --> 00:00:17.163
He liked the story.

3
00:00:17.164 --> 00:00:19.284
But it was hard to hear.

4
00:00:19.285 --> 00:00:24.339
His ears felt plugged up.

5
00:00:24.340 --> 00:00:36.761
Jemima was still making soup.

6
00:00:36.762 --> 00:00:38.984
She brought a pepper to Jeremy.

7
00:00:38.985 --> 00:00:40.980
"Eat this," she said.

8
00:00:40.981 --> 00:00:49.455
"Hot peppers are good for colds."

9
00:00:49.456 --> 00:00:53.032
Jeremy bit the hot pepper.

10
00:00:53.033 --> 00:00:57.766
It burned his mouth.

11
00:00:57.767 --> 00:01:03.234
"Water!" he gasped.

12
00:01:03.235 --> 00:01:06.660
"You don't need water," Mrs. Rabbit said.

13
00:01:06.661 --> 00:01:09.394
"Your house has too much water!"

14
00:01:09.395 --> 00:01:14.616
She mopped up another puddle.

15
00:01:14.617 --> 00:01:17.339
Jemima came over again.

16
00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:20.443
"Now try some garlic," she said.

17
00:01:20.444 --> 00:01:32.655
She tried to feed some to Jeremy.

18
00:01:32.656 --> 00:01:35.499
"Stop!" Jeremy cried.

19
00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:38.181
Ribby gasped.

20
00:01:38.182 --> 00:01:40.669
His three friends stared at him.

21
00:01:40.670 --> 00:01:47.597
Jeremy coughed.

22
00:01:47.598 --> 00:01:53.980
He blew his nose.

23
00:01:53.981 --> 00:01:57.492
"I am very tired," he said.

24
00:01:57.493 --> 00:02:00.894
"I am going back to bed now."

25
00:02:00.895 --> 00:02:04.755
"Sleep is good for a cold," Ribby said.

26
00:02:04.756 --> 00:02:06.428
Jemima nodded.

27
00:02:06.429 --> 00:02:09.341
"You can eat the soup when you wake up."

28
00:02:09.342 --> 00:02:12.765
"We will all come back tomorrow," Jemima said.

29
00:02:12.766 --> 00:02:16.077
"That's okay," Jeremy said quickly.

30
00:02:16.078 --> 00:02:20.208
"I will still be asleep!"
